 locked into fixed paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want it, you can get it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191830/extras/f70ffb24ccaaa9ac1aba55868a40ca55.poster.avif?t=1776223588\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191830/extras/f70ffb24ccaaa9ac1aba55868a40ca55.webm?t=1776223588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191830/extras/f70ffb24ccaaa9ac1aba55868a40ca55.mp4?t=1776223588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party-Focused Gameplay &amp; Dynamic PvE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-focused gameplay lies at the heart of the experience, featuring <strong>Party Wave</strong>, large-scale faction battles, and dynamic party-based encounters. In addition, the <strong>Scavenger System</strong> introduces Spirit Scavengers that create unpredictable PvE situations\u2014even during combat\u2014requiring players to constantly adapt their strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191830/extras/9f3addab4f221a0d8d9330cc0eb76f6f.poster.avif?t=1776223588\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191830/extras/9f3addab4f221a0d8d9330cc0eb76f6f.webm?t=1776223588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191830/extras/9f3addab4f221a0d8d9330cc0eb76f6f.mp4?t=1776223588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape the Fate of Iveria</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iverian Wars: Craxion vs Defugel</i> is a 